{"name": "Backdraft", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras_big/f352a2af9e624f79b7f6b7f1587fd0c4.webp?t=1787697814\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/f352a2af9e624f79b7f6b7f1587fd0c4.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run begins with a pairing: choose a hero, then choose a companion. Your hero has a unique power, and your companion unlocks your second elemental card pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/53012ea120bad80c5efbc4c26180a7a5.poster.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/53012ea120bad80c5efbc4c26180a7a5.webm?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/53012ea120bad80c5efbc4c26180a7a5.mp4?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your pairing decides what kind of run you are building. Draft around your strengths, cover your weaknesses, and discover endless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/9aa04249dd94991f67c32d4a6132788f.poster.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/9aa04249dd94991f67c32d4a6132788f.webm?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/9aa04249dd94991f67c32d4a6132788f.mp4?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"DRAFT YOUR DECK\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras_big/1d679ecb62b0ecc9a812a12eafd48f26.webp?t=1787697814\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/1d679ecb62b0ecc9a812a12eafd48f26.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft your deck one shop visit at a time. Open packs, upgrade cards, recruit minions, and uncover artifacts. Spend wisely.\u00a0The fate of your run is built one choice at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/fb2bea5a177a55c17ddf736ee0c509ef.poster.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/fb2bea5a177a55c17ddf736ee0c509ef.webm?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/fb2bea5a177a55c17ddf736ee0c509ef.mp4?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win fights to earn blessings that improve future shops, turning each victory into better choices, bigger rewards, and new ways to shape your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/f683ecab7ceeee7f1f3404ecf632a9b4.poster.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/f683ecab7ceeee7f1f3404ecf632a9b4.webm?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/f683ecab7ceeee7f1f3404ecf632a9b4.mp4?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"SURVIVE THE GAUNTLET\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras_big/422dc5dd258e19a30ca2fa45e1531489.webp?t=1787697814\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/422dc5dd258e19a30ca2fa45e1531489.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your build to the test in the Gauntlet: a series of battles against rival heroes with their own elemental pairings, decks, and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/5932d64765e7f0cb98e9801ffa082eeb.poster.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/5932d64765e7f0cb98e9801ffa082eeb.webm?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/5932d64765e7f0cb98e9801ffa082eeb.mp4?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the right cards, summon powerful minions, and fight your way to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/b616e309900f4c1521f11a3dc687ece1.poster.avif?t=1787697814\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/b616e309900f4c1521f11a3dc687ece1.webm?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/extras/b616e309900f4c1521f11a3dc687ece1.mp4?t=1787697814\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Draft. Fight. Repeat. It\u2019s hero vs hero in a roguelike battle for board control. Summon minions, stack enchantments, and chain attacks into devastating combos. Decide when to clear the board, defend your team, or strike the rival hero.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218060/714cbcdf9d78286eb3b673345a135c3fecf6b9c2/header.jpg?t=1787697814", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Game", "Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Card Battler", "Roguelike", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Legacy Labs", "publishers": "Legacy Labs", "release_date": "November 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2218060", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/THGqSacBRZM", "first_seen": 1777507200.0}